<title>USA: CBOE to list HSN Inc options on Dec 23.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list HSN Inc options on Dec 23.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said Thursday it would start trading options on shares of HSN Inc on December 23.</p>
<p>HSN is the company formed from Silver King Communications Inc's acquisition of an 80.1 percent stake in Home Shopping Network Inc. Shareholders of the two companies are scheduled to vote on the transaction today.</p>
<p>The CBOE said HSN options will have initial strike prices at 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2, with introductory expirations in January, February, April and July. The options will trade in the Ford Motor Co crowd.</p>
</text>
